\v 14 \w And Elisha| strong="H477" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, As the \sc Lord\sc* \w of hosts| strong="H6635" \w* \w liveth| strong="H2416" \w*, \w before| strong="H6440" \w* [whom I stand]{strong=“H5975” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [surely, were it not that]{strong=“H3884”} [I regard]{strong=“H5375” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w the presence| strong="H6440" \w* \w of Jehoshaphat| strong="H3092" \w* \w the king| strong="H4428" \w* \w of Judah| strong="H3063" \w*, [I would not look]{strong=“H5027” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} [toward thee, nor see]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} thee. 
