\v 10 \w And Elisha| strong="H477" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [unto him, Go]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”}, [say]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} [unto him, Thou mayest certainly]{strong=“H2421” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} [recover]{strong=“H2421” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}: howbeit the \sc Lord\sc* [hath shewed]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} [me that he shall surely]{strong=“H4191” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} [die]{strong=“H4191” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}. 
