\v 6 [Then he wrote]{strong=“H3789” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w a letter| strong="H5612" \w* \w the second time| strong="H8145" \w* [to them, saying]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, If ye be mine, and if [ye will hearken]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w unto my voice| strong="H6963" \w*, [take]{strong=“H3947” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w ye the heads| strong="H7218" \w* \w of the men| strong="H582" \w* [your master’s]{strong=“H113”} \w sons| strong="H1121" \w*, [and come]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w to me to Jezreel| strong="H3157" \w* \w by to morrow| strong="H4279" \w* \w this time| strong="H6256" \w*. [Now the king’s]{strong=“H4428”} \w sons| strong="H1121" \w*, being \w seventy| strong="H7657" \w* \w persons| strong="H376" \w*, were \w with the great men| strong="H1419" \w* \w of the city| strong="H5892" \w*, [which brought them up]{strong=“H1431” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”}.\f + \fr 10:6 \ft mine: Heb. for me \f* 
